{
  "file_name": "f011.bf",
  "total_messages": 127,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "offset": "gale_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Serph, wait.\nIt appears we are in trouble.\nIt is imperative that we establish\na strategy immediately. Let us\ndiscuss this matter inside.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "offset": "arujira_001",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Hold on, Serph.\nWe need to join Sera and Heat.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "offset": "HEAT_JOIN",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> Heat joined the party.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "offset": "hungry",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> Serph and the party feel hungry...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "offset": "hungry02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> They grew weak from hunger.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "offset": "sera_001_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Thank you, Serph.\nI'm fine...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "offset": "sera_001_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "It's a memory...\nI thought I had... erased it, but\nit keeps coming back...\nThere are memories that have been\nforgotten... even by the flow\nof information...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "offset": "heat_001_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "My chest is tearing itself apart...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "offset": "heat_001_02a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "It's nothing...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "offset": "heat_001_02b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I just lost control for a minute.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "offset": "heat_001_03a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "What are you hiding from us, Sera?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "offset": "heat_001_03b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "...You really don't trust me?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "offset": "arujila_001_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Sera called the song \"Prayer\"...\n\"Teach us who we are, and guide\nus to the truth.\"\nThat's what the words mean.\nBut, she also said that it can't\nreach the heavens, because it's\nmissing something important...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "offset": "arujila_001_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I thought Sera was tired again,\nbut something's different this\ntime...\nIs she finally hungry?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "offset": "arujila_001_03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Jinana...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "offset": "arujila_001_04a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "If...\nIf Varin was telling the truth,\ndo you think Sera would want to\nreturn to Nirvana?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "offset": "arujila_001_04b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Is it really for the best?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "offset": "gale_001_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "A prayer that does not reach\nthe heavens... Something important\nthat is missing from it...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "offset": "gale_001_03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I will negotiate with Lupa.\nIt is possible that Varin sent him\nas an assassin.\nA leader cannot be replaced.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "offset": "gale_001_04a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I sang Sera's song, though I\nshould not know it...\n...to someone whose name I do\nnot know, either...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "offset": "gale_001_04b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Who is that woman...?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "offset": "gale_001_05",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Sera probably disappeared because\nshe recalled something of the past.\nI doubt that she wants us to\nfind out about it.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "offset": "ciero_001_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I don't exactly understand it,\nbut thanks to dat song...\n...we can stay human.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "offset": "ciero_001_02a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Sera looks sad again...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "offset": "ciero_001_02b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "She's much cuter when she smiles, ja?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "offset": "ciero_001_03a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Memories... Dey carry so much\nweight, no?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "offset": "ciero_001_03b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "How do I know... what dis feels\nlike, anyway...?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "offset": "ciero_001_04",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Dis sucks... We finally goin' to\nNirvana, but Sera disappeared\non us.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "offset": "npc_001_01_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "It might sound weird, but I feel\nlike I remember something... when\nI hear Sera's song.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "offset": "npc_001_01_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "It might sound weird, but I feel\nlike I remember something... when\nI hear Sera's song.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "offset": "npc_001_01_03a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Everyone has been talking about\npast lives which they can't\nremember...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "offset": "npc_001_01_03b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Is it because of Sera's song?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "offset": "npc_001_01_04a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "At last... there will finally be\na world without killing!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "offset": "npc_001_01_04b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "What a time to be alive...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "offset": "npc_001_02_01a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Everything is fine.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "offset": "npc_001_02_01b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "All we hear is Sera's singing.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "offset": "npc_001_02_02a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Heat must like Sera a lot...\nYou can tell how desperate he is\njust by looking.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "offset": "npc_001_02_02b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I don't know what the big deal is...\nI would taste better than her.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "offset": "npc_001_02_03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "This hideout is pretty much\nin ruins, too.\nThe Junkyard is literally a city\nbuilt upon piles of junk...\nBut, who destroyed those cities\nso we could build this one?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "offset": "npc_001_02_04",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "It feels like memories are junk\nstored in the back of my head...\n...with someone else's thoughts.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "offset": "npc_001_03_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I just gave Gale my report on\nthe state of the Wolves and Brutes.\nHe can give you an update.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "offset": "npc_001_04_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "This song touches my... soul.\nIt sounds sad, but very comforting.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "offset": "npc_001_04_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Take the black-haired girl to\nNirvana...\n...and conquer the Junkyard.\nI wish we had a choice between\nthe two.\nI'd easily choose the latter.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "offset": "npc_001_04_03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "People don't like leaving their\nhome. You can see the remains of\ntheir lives in the ground.\nI've even heard that strange buildings\nare growing in the Brutes' hideout.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "offset": "npc_001_04_04",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I can remember a time before I died...\nI'm sure of it.\nI remember being with other people,\nand always competing at something.\nHumans seem the same, no matter\nthe circumstances...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "offset": "sera_002_01a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "......",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "offset": "sera_002_01b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Don't worry... I'm fine.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "offset": "heat_002_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "It's nothing...\nGet going. I'll take care of Sera.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "offset": "heat_002_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Sera, um... Well, you know...\nDon't push yourself too hard...\nIt's like Lupa said, all we need to do\nis reach Nirvana...\nI'll take you there.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "offset": "heat_002_03a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I don't care who tries to stop us,\nwe're taking Sera to Nirvana!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "offset": "heat_002_03b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "That's the only way we can find out\nthe truth about her...\nI want to help her.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "offset": "arujila_002_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Sera should come with us. We can't\nafford to have her taken again.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "offset": "arujila_002_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I don't know, either.\nBut, I feel like I know many\nthings that I shouldn't know.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "offset": "arujila_002_03a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "The Karma Temple...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "offset": "arujila_002_03b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I never thought about it, but...\nwhat exactly is the Karma Temple?\nWhere did it come from?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "offset": "gale_002_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "We may be able to compensate for\nour small numbers, if the Wolves\nare fighting at full power.\nBut, on the other hand, it is possible\nthat Varin is behind this.\nWhatever the case, we will soon\nfind out for ourselves...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "offset": "gale_002_02a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I do not know what \"Cyber Shaman\"\nmeans.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "offset": "gale_002_02b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "It is best to ask Varin directly.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "offset": "gale_002_03a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Angel of the Karma Temple,\nwho seeks the Cyber Shaman...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "offset": "gale_002_03b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Who is this... Angel...?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "offset": "ciero_002_01a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "What's Heat's problem?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "offset": "ciero_002_01b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "And, why'd Sera go ova dere...?\nDis certainly seems strange, ja?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "offset": "ciero_002_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "No way...\nSera could never do such a ting!\nBut, it would be pretty funny if\nshe was dat strong, with her\nskinny little body!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "offset": "ciero_002_03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "How can we all feel like we known\nSera forever...\n...but none of us know de name\nCyber Shaman?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "offset": "sera_002_02a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Cy...ber... Shaman...\ndestroys the... world...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "offset": "sera_002_02b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I don't...\nI... don't know...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "offset": "npc_003_01_01a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Special delivery...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "offset": "npc_003_01_01b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "That is, I mean, I have a message\nfor you.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "offset": "npc_003_01_01c",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "It seems they've found a place\nwhere the Citadel connects to\nthe sewer system.\nHowever, those who went in never\ncame back out...\nDo you think something happened?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "offset": "npc_003_01_02a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Sir, can you sign for this?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "offset": "npc_003_01_02b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "...er, I mean, I have a message\nfor you.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "offset": "npc_003_01_02c",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I hear someone is wandering around\nthe area looking for \"his lover,\nwho wasted away at his side.\"\nHe's supposed to be strong, too.\nBe careful... you wouldn't want to\npick a fight with that guy.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "offset": "npc_003_02_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Message to the commander of\nthe Embryon, from a squad stationed\nnear the Manipura area:\nWe've found an entrance to the sewer\nsystem beneath the Maribel's former\nterritory.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "offset": "npc_002_01_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Svadhisthana used to belong to\nthe Vanguards.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 74,
      "offset": "npc_002_01_02a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Cyber Shaman?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "offset": "npc_002_01_02b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I think I've heard that somewhere\nbefore...\nBut, I have a feeling it isn't\na very good memory...",
      "texte_fr": "",
