    {
      "id": 79,
      "offset": "npc_003_04_01a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Well, with that freaky red wall\nthere, I'm sure we'll be safe.\nBut, I suppose it could disappear\nat any time. At that point, I don't know\nwhat will happen.\nHmm... Now I'm a little worried.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
